,"output_token_details":{"reasoning":54}}},{"content":"total 12\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 1008 1009 4096 Jul 22 17:10 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 1008 1009 4096 Jul 22 17:10 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 1008 1009  328 Jul 22 17:10 trajectory_points.csv","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"1301bfd9-473d-42f3-8b16-d2706fd4ba78","tool_call_id":"call_907cca615c3b43909dca3565","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":159,"prompt_tokens":11599,"total_tokens":11758,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":77,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":159},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11599}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-42727457-6925-95e8-b52f-4ce0762fe009","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f65-72ac-7f92-88de-06542972729b-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"find /mnt/datasets -type f -name \"*.csv\" -o -name \"*.json\" -o -name \"*.txt\" 2>/dev/null | head -30","description":"查找所有可能的数据文件"},"id":"call_c5f9285b1cc3457da0d4810d","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11599,"output_tokens":159,"total_tokens":11758,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":77}}}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/7fc42c8e-9eb9-4b78-8300-5fc3154c9d71/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/7fc42c8e-9eb9-4b78-8300-5fc3154c9d71/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/7fc42c8e-9eb9-4b78-8300-5fc3154c9d71/user-data/outputs"},"title":"夜间禁区告警生成","artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"请根据“夜间有人进入禁区并连续停留超过 30 秒”这个条件，从检测结果中生成候选告警。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"34a902ce-1542-4d08-9f3a-95612aaf992d"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): video_surveillance. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请根据“夜间有人进入禁区并连续停留超过 30 秒”这个条件，从检测结果中生成候选告警。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"d4cbb12d-26b9-469f-991a-00a014ad5614"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance\n识别场景：视频监控 (video_surveillance)；场景模式：single；候选场景：video_surveillance\n任务切分：\n- 请根据“夜间有人进入禁区并连续停留超过 30 秒”这个条件，从检测结果中生成候选告警。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取原始检测结果数据集，解析目标类别、空间区域标签、时间戳与轨迹ID字段，将其转换为结构化事件记录表。\n2. 调用视频监控场景的时空过滤能力，依据系统预设的“夜间”时段界定标准与禁区电子围栏，剔除不符合时间与空间范围的事件片段。\n3. 基于行为识别规则对初筛轨迹进行连续停留时长统计，以无跨区中断为判断口径，筛选出在禁区内滞留时长大于等于30秒的目标序列。\n4. 将命中阈值的轨迹数据映射至标准告警模板，封装视频流标识、触发帧序号、停留精确秒数及所属禁区名称，生成结构化的候选告警清单以供下游业务调用。\n场景任务：\n- video_surveillance: 我将根据视频监控场景中夜间人员进入禁区并连续停留超过30秒的条件，从检测结果中生成候选告警。；参数：{'监控目标': '人员进入禁区并连续停留超过30秒', '时间范围': '夜间', '输出形式': '候选告警'}\n已提取参数：{'监控目标': '人员进入禁区并连续停留超过30秒', '时间范围': '夜间', '输出形式': '候选告警'}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"38432c32-93ab-4f15-8266-7999194c6f6b"},{"content":"我来帮您从检测结果中筛选符合\"夜间有人进入禁区并连续停留超过30秒\"条件的候选告警。\n\n首先，让我查看一下当前的数据和文件情况：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":322,"prompt_tokens":10900,"total_tokens":11222,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":187,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":322},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10900}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-a7b63fe4-8df9-9523-a218-276993a8c3c0","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f8f64-8fdf-7130-9794-0c2d89824088-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ls -la /mnt/user-data/uploads/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la /mnt/user-data/workspace/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la /mnt/datasets/ 2>/dev/null","description":"检查上传文件、工作目录和数据集目录"},"id":"call_12d6a2999a0946ceaa7427b8","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10900,"output_tokens":322,"total_tok